BU Bench (https://github.com/browser-use/benchmark)
  benchmarks/bu-bench/browser-use-benchmark is a git submodule: this repository records which
  BU Bench commit to use (v2.1.1) and includes none of its files. benchmarks/bu-bench/misty_eval.py
  imports BU Bench's code from that checkout (task loading, selection, the findings judge, scoring
  and summaries); none of that code is copied here. Its evidence layout and the task prompt follow
  BU Bench's BrowserCode runner.
  The BU Bench repository states no license of its own; its README asks that decrypted
  tasks and rubrics are never published or used for training, and this repository keeps run data
  out of version control.
